        "date": "2026-01-29T22:27:36Z"
      },
      "message": "[Zvbc32e] Integrating Zvbc32e specification into the vector-crypto chapter\n\nThis changes introduces a new extension, dubbed Zvbc32e, which extends the instructions defined in Zvbc (vclmul.v[x,v] and vclmulh.v[x,v]) to support SEW 8, 16 or 32.\nIt was developped in the context of a fast track supported by RVIA Cryptography SIG and was submitted after Zvbc had been ratified.",
      "tree": {
